' ============================================================
' Barber Queue Management System - 01 Use Case Diagrams (v2)
' 5 views. Numbering is global: UC01..UC99 (no duplicates).
' Reading rules:
'   * Queue Operator = Barber (own queue) | Queue Manager (assigned queues)
'                      | Secondary Owner (all queues). Primary Owner inherits.
'   * STAFF has no queue rights by itself: only through a QUEUE_MANAGER assignment.
'   * Every staff action that changes data is written to AUDIT_LOG (see 04-business-rules).
'   * Permissions are checked in the Backend, per salon (never from a global JWT role).
' ============================================================

